#: ../../library/omv.display.ST7701.rst:4
msgid "class ST7701 -- Display Controller"
msgstr "class ST7701 -- 顯示控制器"

#: ../../library/omv.display.ST7701.rst:6
msgid ""
"The `ST7701` class initializes the ST7701 LCD controller used by MIPI DSI "
"panels."
msgstr "`ST7701` 類別用於初始化 MIPI DSI 面板所使用的 ST7701 LCD 控制器。"

#: ../../library/omv.display.ST7701.rst:9
msgid "Constructors"
msgstr "建構子"

#: ../../library/omv.display.ST7701.rst:13
msgid ""
"Creates a controller object. Pass it as the ``controller`` argument to "
"`DSIDisplay()` which will invoke `ST7701.init()` automatically."
msgstr ""
"建立一個控制器物件。將其作為 ``controller`` 引數傳遞給 `DSIDisplay()`\\ ，後者會自動呼叫 "
"`ST7701.init()`\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.display.ST7701.rst:18
msgid "Initializes the display."
msgstr "初始化顯示器。"

#: ../../library/omv.display.ST7701.rst:20
msgid ""
"``dc`` is the display controller object that must provide ``bus_write()`` "
"and ``bus_read()`` methods (typically a `display.DSIDisplay` instance)."
msgstr ""
"``dc`` 是顯示控制器物件，必須提供 ``bus_write()`` 與 ``bus_read()`` 方法（通常是 "
"`display.DSIDisplay` 實例）。"

#: ../../library/omv.display.ST7701.rst:22
msgid ""
"``dt`` is the display timing/configuration argument forwarded by the display"
" controller."
msgstr "``dt`` 是由顯示控制器轉遞的顯示時序／組態引數。"

#: ../../library/omv.display.ST7701.rst:27
msgid "Returns the 3-byte display id read from register ``0x04``."
msgstr "傳回從暫存器 ``0x04`` 讀取的 3 位元組顯示 id。"

#: ../../library/omv.display.ST7701.rst:32
